<title>UK: Stagecoach rights issue take-up 97.04 pct.</title>
<headline>Stagecoach rights issue take-up 97.04 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stagecoach Holdings Plc, the UK bus operator, said on Thursday that it had received valid applications for 97.04 percent of shares allotted under its rights issue by 1400 GMT on Wednesday 18 September.</p>
<p>Certificates for the new ordinary shares will be sent to investors by October 16.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
